[{:db/id "89981f02-ad8a-513e-828a-e400b88e66d3" :answer/id #uuid "89981f02-ad8a-513e-828a-e400b88e66d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{4y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5e22d1ff-80c3-5392-a495-c399a03b3ab0" :answer/id #uuid "5e22d1ff-80c3-5392-a495-c399a03b3ab0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{-4y}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "42b0ce1a-0757-53db-93de-7de1b53bce5a" :answer/id #uuid "42b0ce1a-0757-53db-93de-7de1b53bce5a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{4y}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0137e495-9519-563c-a9ee-6f5584f3dcad" :answer/id #uuid "0137e495-9519-563c-a9ee-6f5584f3dcad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-4y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0bea7869-a91a-5392-b25d-ed17806c1610" :answer/id #uuid "0bea7869-a91a-5392-b25d-ed17806c1610" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{4y}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0a0a0640-dade-51e4-9d76-499e8b522693" :answer-field/id #uuid "0a0a0640-dade-51e4-9d76-499e8b522693" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["89981f02-ad8a-513e-828a-e400b88e66d3" "5e22d1ff-80c3-5392-a495-c399a03b3ab0" "42b0ce1a-0757-53db-93de-7de1b53bce5a" "0137e495-9519-563c-a9ee-6f5584f3dcad" "0bea7869-a91a-5392-b25d-ed17806c1610"] :answer-field/correct "0137e495-9519-563c-a9ee-6f5584f3dcad" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "03ab52b6-83e6-54a5-afb6-55184c5bbcb6" :question/id #uuid "03ab52b6-83e6-54a5-afb6-55184c5bbcb6" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x+4y}\n$$\n\nWork on a domain where all displayed expressions are defined." :question/worked-solution "A differential equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differential equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x}\\cdot {e}^{4y}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{{e}^{4y}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x},\n$$\n\nor, equivalently,\n\n$$\n{e}^{-4y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["0a0a0640-dade-51e4-9d76-499e8b522693"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "d87ff72b-4395-583b-be61-bc1afd372800" :answer/id #uuid "d87ff72b-4395-583b-be61-bc1afd372800" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3x+2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{3+{y}^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f3ff3107-a7d2-59db-8b09-67444edeaf28" :answer/id #uuid "f3ff3107-a7d2-59db-8b09-67444edeaf28" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(3x+2)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{3+{y}^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8e4c9bb6-7717-511c-8838-e3db42547443" :answer/id #uuid "8e4c9bb6-7717-511c-8838-e3db42547443" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(3+{y}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3x+2}{x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2346f555-930d-5070-98b7-5e1217159460" :answer/id #uuid "2346f555-930d-5070-98b7-5e1217159460" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(3+{y}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{3x+2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0e7c3b77-c214-557e-a804-a347cce54372" :answer/id #uuid "0e7c3b77-c214-557e-a804-a347cce54372" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3+{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{3x+2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "11a3a2ee-3214-5652-a1e8-c95275af79fc" :answer-field/id #uuid "11a3a2ee-3214-5652-a1e8-c95275af79fc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["d87ff72b-4395-583b-be61-bc1afd372800" "f3ff3107-a7d2-59db-8b09-67444edeaf28" "8e4c9bb6-7717-511c-8838-e3db42547443" "2346f555-930d-5070-98b7-5e1217159460" "0e7c3b77-c214-557e-a804-a347cce54372"] :answer-field/correct "2346f555-930d-5070-98b7-5e1217159460" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "aa110f6f-e8a3-5f93-ae17-13ecc7c36e75" :question/id #uuid "aa110f6f-e8a3-5f93-ae17-13ecc7c36e75" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{9x+3x{y}^{2}+6+2{y}^{2}}\n$$\n\nWork on a domain where all displayed expressions are defined." :question/worked-solution "A differential equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differential equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{x}{(3x+2)(3+{y}^{2})} \\\\  & =\\frac{x}{3x+2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3+{y}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n(3+{y}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{3x+2}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["11a3a2ee-3214-5652-a1e8-c95275af79fc"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "2d681c76-75f8-5a31-94d4-5eb6019d8fb6" :answer/id #uuid "2d681c76-75f8-5a31-94d4-5eb6019d8fb6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(3+{y}^{4})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2x+2}{x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5b6814b3-8f36-5644-b687-0444e7ab