rated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differential equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{x}{(2x+2)(3+{y}^{4})} \\\\  & =\\frac{x}{2x+2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3+{y}^{4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n(3+{y}^{4})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{2x+2}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["5a356b80-c6dc-5374-83ae-82cbe3679ce2"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "ccd8ba74-f3ec-5ca8-a446-60f1b1676907" :answer/id #uuid "ccd8ba74-f3ec-5ca8-a446-60f1b1676907" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2+{y}^{4})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{5x}{2x+4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4afec3df-d25f-5250-be9a-b8e235f33d66" :answer/id #uuid "4afec3df-d25f-5250-be9a-b8e235f33d66" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2x+4)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{5x}{2+{y}^{4}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "50fd0c44-809b-56e8-bffa-64daf91f5728" :answer/id #uuid "50fd0c44-809b-56e8-bffa-64daf91f5728" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2+{y}^{4})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2x+4}{5x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1636c696-c883-5327-b1d1-95d5845e693a" :answer/id #uuid "1636c696-c883-5327-b1d1-95d5845e693a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2+{y}^{4}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{5x}{2x+4}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a0365396-629f-5676-a2ff-5f577f030cc8" :answer/id #uuid "a0365396-629f-5676-a2ff-5f577f030cc8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2x+4}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{5x}{2+{y}^{4}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a98e2cd8-e387-5cb8-a456-9bec570be0f3" :answer-field/id #uuid "a98e2cd8-e387-5cb8-a456-9bec570be0f3" :answer-field/key "selection" 